# Keep the build context to what the image needs. Secrets and local data must never reach it.
# Patterns start with **/ so they also match nested copies, not only the context root.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/.npmrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.git
.github
**/.worktrees
**/.cache
**/node_modules
dist
coverage
fixtures/downloads
playwright-report
test-results
handoff
HANDOFF*.md
**/*.log
